# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile (context = repo root).
# Dependencies are installed from the lockfile inside the image; outputs are rebuilt.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/test-results-*
**/playwright-report
**/playwright-report-*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
# Secrets and runtime data never enter an image; env comes from the orchestrator.
# Every env file, the committed templates included (audit 2026-10-11, R5: the
# web image shipped apps/web/.env.production because Next's standalone output
# copies it): the builds take NEXT_PUBLIC_* from build arguments and the
# containers run on the orchestrator's environment and the class defaults.
# The documented examples stay (nothing reads them; they hold no values).
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
apps/api/data
apps/api/uploads
**/dump.rdb
# Not needed to build or run the servers.
apps/api/test
apps/api/load
apps/web/e2e
apps/web/e2e-*
docs
*.md
!apps/api/prisma/MIGRATIONS.md
